Description: deepin skills for AI agents
 deepin skills organizes framework knowledge, plugin APIs, engineering
 guidance and evaluation cases into on-demand skills for building native
 deepin/UOS applications and DDE desktop plugins.
 This package installs the default skills used by the UOS AI.
